This file marks the Conduct source repository. Presence of this file at a
repo root enables the pretouse hook's DEV_PATH_MARKERS exclusions, so
doc-sensitive framework rules (IRS 1075, ISO 42001 responsible-use, NIST
docs, etc.) do not false-fire on writes to Conduct's own guard/hooks/tests
code that names those concepts by name.

Do not add this file to customer repositories. It is Conduct-internal only.

See packages/conduct-cli/src/conduct_cli/hooks/pretouse.py for the marker
list and the walk-up-to-find logic.
